    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Working.</strong> <em>A martial pact with a sky that keeps score.</em></p>\n<p>Name a creature within 60 ft and speak a vow against it. The next time it misses an attack against the adept or one of the adept's allies, lightning answers: it takes 2d8 electrical damage and the vow ends. The vow lasts the scene; the adept holds one vow at a time, and a new vow moves it.</p>\n<p><strong>Cost.</strong> 2 Clarity, +1 Noise · action · one creature / 60 ft.</p>\n<p><em>Ozone smell, and a bell rings somewhere in Valhaul.</em></p>"
    }
